# Code owners are requested for review automatically when a pull request
# touches a path they own. Last match wins, so the more specific rules
# below override the catch-all.
#
# There is one maintainer today, so every rule here resolves to the same
# person and nothing is gated differently in practice. The paths are
# still listed individually because they are the ones where a review is
# least optional — a security boundary, a wire format, or something that
# ships signed. When there are more maintainers, this is the file where
# a narrower team goes on those lines, and the split is already drawn.

*                               @WangYihang

# --- Security boundaries -------------------------------------------
# The plugin capability sandbox: the filesystem allowlist, the command
# allowlist, and signature verification for plugin artefacts.
/internal/agent/plugin/         @WangYihang

# Enrollment, identity, and the mTLS setup between agent and server.
/internal/agent/identity*.go    @WangYihang
/internal/agent/enroll*.go      @WangYihang
/internal/agent/bootstrap.go    @WangYihang
/internal/enrollment/           @WangYihang
/internal/cryptobox/            @WangYihang

# Authn/authz on the server side.
/internal/api/auth*.go          @WangYihang
/internal/storage/roles.go      @WangYihang

# Peer-to-peer links — cert verification and stream adoption.
/internal/mesh/                 @WangYihang

# --- Contracts ------------------------------------------------------
# Wire format. A change here is a compatibility decision for every
# deployed agent, not just for main.
/proto/                         @WangYihang
/pkg/proto/                     @WangYihang
/internal/link/                 @WangYihang

# --- Supply chain ---------------------------------------------------
# What CI does, what Dependabot opens, and what gets signed and shipped.
/.github/                       @WangYihang
/.golangci.yml                  @WangYihang
/.pre-commit-config.yaml        @WangYihang
/scripts/                       @WangYihang
/.goreleaser.yaml               @WangYihang

# --- Policy ---------------------------------------------------------
/SECURITY.md                    @WangYihang
/CONTRIBUTING.md                @WangYihang
